  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 402.09 \"Dial tone\" means an aural tone that indicates to the telephone end-user that the handset is able to place a call.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Puc 400) #14029, eff 7-25-24 (formerly Puc 402.08)",
